 "intro_zh": "喀什噶尔老城景区，面积4.25平方公里，约有居民12.68万人。老城区街巷纵横交错，布局灵活多变，曲径通幽，民居大多为土木、砖木结构，不少传统民居已有上百年的历史，是以伊斯兰文化为特色的迷宫式城市街区。",
 "intro_en": "Kashgar Old City Scenic Area covers an area of ​​4.25 square kilometers and has approximately 126,800 residents. The streets and alleys in the old city are criss-crossed, with flexible layouts and winding paths. Most of the residences are made of earth, wood, brick and wood structures. Many traditional residences have a history of hundreds of years. It is a labyrinth-like urban block characterized by Islamic culture.",
 "intro_en_source": "machine_translation",
